# Water Tribe Rallier: "Waterbend {5}: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card with power 3
# or less from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." Waterbend
# (CR 701.67a) taps the Rallier itself for one of the five: one short is refused with four sources, five in all pay it and
# leave the pool empty. Of the top four (Serra Angel 4/4, an Island, Grizzly Bears 2/2, Hill Giant 3/3) Bears and Giant qualify, the Giant at
# power exactly 3, but only one may be taken, and the fifth card (a Savannah Lions that would qualify) is not among the four. Bot2 has a Hill Giant in its library
# too, which stays there.

